#!/bin/sh
# Restarts the agent-seat database service when a merge into ned-box's
# reference-checkout changes the service; in every other checkout the program
# does nothing. Git passes one argument, whether the merge was a squash, which
# the program does not need.
exec python3 "$(dirname "$0")/../../nc-systems/agent-seat-database/agent-seat-database-service-restart-after-merge.py"
